        "evidence_id": "E009",
        "passage_id": "P004",
        "quote": "By submitting the deposition testimony of the director of the preschool and the injured plaintiff, the defendant established, prima facie, that it did not have actual or constructive notice of the alleged ice that caused the plaintiff to fall",
